{"articleNo":"225033","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=225033&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [한국기술사업화진흥협회] 실업자국기과정 \"SMART공장 맞춤형 품질·생산관리자 양성과정\"교육생 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.05.24","hit":"12988","attachments":[{"name":"한국기술사업화진흥협회_실업자국기 교육생 안내공문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=225033&attachNo=79927"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">1. 교육기간</span></strong></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">: 2019. 06. 18.(화) ~ 10. 22.(화), 4개월 과정, 총 37명 모집(일 7시간 훈련)</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>2. 자격대상</strong></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">: 만 15세 이상 구직자, 대학(교)졸업예정자, 청년실업자, 내일배움카드 소지자(실업자) 및 취업성공패키지 참여자</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>3. 교육혜택</strong></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">: 교육비 전액 무료, 월 최대 116,000원 훈련장려금 지급</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>4. 신청방법 및 기간</strong></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">: 2019. 06. 11.(화) 18:00까지 접수</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">- 홈페이지 접수 바로가기-&gt; </span><a href=\"http://www.ktca-edu.or.kr/edu/edu_special_view/57\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">http://www.ktca-edu.or.kr/edu/edu_special_view/57</span></font></u></span></a></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">- 이메일 접수-&gt; </span><a href=\"http://www.ktca-edu.or.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 10pt;\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">www.ktca-edu.or.kr</span></font></u></span></a><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;(이력서 첨부)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">- 전화상담: 053-721-6558</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※&nbsp;실업자 국기과정은 내일배움카드(실업자) 소지자에 한하여 수강이 가능하며, </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 개강 2~4주전에는 상담 및 내일배움카드 신청이 되어야 합니다.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
